# The sentence spec.Sentence writes for testdata/templates/pre-review-what-asks-for-me.json. Rewrite with
# go test ./internal/autopilot/spec -run TestSentenceGolden -update

When a pull request asking for your review gets new commits, the first one included, if it isn't a draft and its size is XS, S, M, or L, run "Quick look" in the background, read only. At most 2 tries per pull request.
